The function then iterates through the first `m` characters of `str1` and the first `n` characters of `str2` and updates the value of `dp[i][j]` based on the length of the longest common subsequence of the first `i-1` characters of `str1` and the first `j-1` characters of `str2`.
The function returns the value of `dp[m][n]`, which represents the length of the longest common subsequence of the two input strings.
