print(result)  # Output: 5
```
This function will find the majority element in the given integer array by iterating through each element, keeping a dictionary to track the majority elements. If an element is not in the dictionary, it is added to the dictionary. If an element is in the dictionary and is greater than its corresponding element in the dictionary, it is updated to be the majority element. Finally, the majority element is returned
